            0.108,
            0.927,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "**3. Here is a 2 × 3 grid. For each row and column, the parity of the sum is written in the circle; ‘e’ for even and ‘o’ for odd. Fill the 6 boxes with 3 odd numbers (‘o’) and 3 even numbers (‘e’) to satisfy the parity of the row and column sums.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.429,
            0.195,
            0.66,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_29_image_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.319,
            0.364,
            0.338
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** One of the ways is –"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.348,
            0.671,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_29_image_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.481,
            0.402,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": "Try more combinations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.525,
            0.897,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": "**4. Make a 3 × 3 magic square with 0 as the magic sum. All numbers cannot be zero. Use negative numbers, as needed.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.568,
            0.504,
            0.586
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** One of the such magic squares is –"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.437,
            0.609,
            0.605,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "| 3 | -4 | 1 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| -2 | 0 | 2 |\n| -1 | 4 | -3 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_29_table_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.731,
            0.651,
            0.749
          ],
          "content": "**5. Fill in the following blanks with ‘odd’ or ‘even’:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.752,
            0.699,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": "(a) Sum of an odd number of even numbers is"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.773,
            0.7,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": "(b) Sum of an even number of odd numbers is"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.794,
            0.706,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": "(c) Sum of an even number of even numbers is"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.814,
            0.69,
            0.853
          ],
          "content": "(d) Sum of an odd number of odd numbers is **Ans:**"
